    "Kenya requires most visitors to hold an Electronic Travel Authorisation\n(eTA) before departure. Apply through the Government of Kenya's official\nportal at <a href=\"https://www.etakenya.go.ke/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">etakenya.go.ke</a>.": "Kenya要求大多数访客在出发前持有电子旅行许可(eTA)。请通过Kenya政府官方门户网站<a href=\"https://www.etakenya.go.ke/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">etakenya.go.ke</a>申请。",
    "Requirements change. Check the official portal, and confirm with the Kenyan\nembassy or high commission covering the country of departure.": "要求可能变更。请查看官方门户网站,并与负责出发国的Kenya大使馆或高级专员公署确认。",
